\n\nTherefore, from Subbranch 1a1a (which was (3,0)->(3,1)), we have:\n\nFrom (3,1):\n\n- To (3,2): 2 paths\n\n- To (2,2): 4 paths\n\nTotal: 6 paths.\n\nTherefore, Subbranch 1a1a (which was (3,0)->(3,1)) leads to 6 paths.\n\nSubbranch 1a1b: (3,0)->(2,1)\n\nVisited: {..., (2,1)}\n\nStep 5 from (2,1):\n\nOptions: (3,1), (2,2), (1,2)\n\nSubbranch 1a1b1: (2,1)->(3,1)\n\nVisited: {..., (3,1)}\n\nFrom (3,1), as before:\n\n- To (3,2): 2 paths\n\n- To (2,2): 4 paths\n\nTotal: 6 paths.\n\nSubbranch 1a1b2: (2,1)->(2,2)\n\nVisited: {..., (2,2)}\n\nFrom (2,2), as before, leads to 4 paths.\n\nSubbranch 1a1b3: (2,1)->(1,2)\n\nVisited: {..., (1,2)}\n\nFrom (1,2):\n\nOptions: (2,2), (1,3)\n\nSubbranch 1a1b3a: (1,2)->(2,2)\n\nVisited: {..., (2,2)}\n\nFrom (2,2), leads to 4 paths.\n\nSubbranch 1a1b3b: (1,2)->(1,3)\n\nVisited: {..., (1,3)}\n\nFrom (1,3):\n\nOptions: (2,3)\n\nSubbranch 1a1b3b1: (1,3)->(2,3)->(3,3): 1 path.\n\nTherefore, from (1,2)->(1,3) leads to 1 path.\n\nThus, from (1,2):\n\n- To (2,2): 4 paths\n\n- To (1,3): 1 path\n\nTotal: 5 paths.\n\nTherefore, Subbranch 1a1b3 (which was (2,1)->(1,2)) leads to 5 paths.\n\nTherefore, Subbranch 1a1b (which was (3,0)->(2,1)) has branches leading to:\n\n- 6 (from 1a1b1) + 4 (from 1a1b2) + 5 (from 1a1b3) = 15 paths? Wait, no:\n\nWait, Subbranch 1a1b is the path (3,0)->(2,1). From (2,1), we have three subbranches:\n\n1a1b1: (2,1)->(3,1) leading to 6 paths.\n\n1a1b2: (2,1)->(2,2) leading to 4 paths.\n\n1a1b3: (2,1)->(1,2) leading to 5 paths.\n\nTherefore, total from Subbranch 1a1b: 6 + 4 + 5 = 15 paths.\n\nWait, but each of these is a separate path from the starting point. So yes, adding them up.\n\nTherefore, Subbranch 1a1 (which was (2,0)->(3,0)) has:\n\n- Subbranch 1a1a: 6 paths\n\n- Subbranch 1a1b: 15 paths\n\nTotal: 21 paths from Subbranch 1a1 (the entire path starting with (0,0)->(1,0)->(2,0)->(3,0))\n\nNow, moving to the other main branch from the start:\n\nBranch 2: (0,0) -> (0,1)\n\nVisited: {(0,0), (0,1)}\n\nStep 2 from (0,1)