8.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y2 vs Y2: same, overlapping.\n\n2 &9: R2 and R9.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y2 vs Y3: overlap (Y2=[0,2] and Y3=[1,2] overlap between y=1-2). Thus overlapping.\n\nSo all pairs involving R2 are overlapping.\n\n3 &4: R3 and R4.\n\nx: X1 vs X2: overlap.\n\ny: Y3 vs Y1. These are adjacent in y (Y3 starts at y=1, Y1 ends at y=1). So share a vertex at y=1. Thus overlapping.\n\n3 &5: R3 and R5.\n\nx: overlap.\n\ny: Y3 vs Y2: overlap (Y2=[0,2], Y3=[1,2] overlap between 1-2). Overlapping.\n\n3 &6: R3 and R6.\n\nx: overlap.\n\ny: same Y3. Overlapping.\n\n3 &7: R3 and R7.\n\nx: X1 vs X3: adjacent.\n\ny: Y3 vs Y1: share a vertex at y=1. Overlapping.\n\n3 &8: R3 and R8.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y3 vs Y2: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n3 &9: R3 and R9.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: same Y3. Overlapping.\n\n4 &5: R4 and R5.\n\nx: X2 vs X2: same, so overlap.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y2: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n4 &6: R4 and R6.\n\nx: X2 vs X2: same.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y3: adjacent in y (share y=1). Overlapping.\n\n4 &7: R4 and R7.\n\nx: X2 vs X3: adjacent.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y1: same. Overlapping.\n\n4 &8: R4 and R8.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y2: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n4 &9: R4 and R9.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y3: share y=1. Overlapping.\n\n5 &6: R5 and R6.\n\nx: same X2.\n\ny: Y2 vs Y3: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n5 &7: R5 and R7.\n\nx: X2 vs X3: adjacent.\n\ny: Y2 vs Y1: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n5 &8: R5 and R8.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: same Y2. Overlapping.\n\n5 &9: R5 and R9.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: Y2 vs Y3: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n6 &7: R6 and R7.\n\nx: X2 vs X3: adjacent.\n\ny: Y3 vs Y1: share y=1. Overlapping.\n\n6 &8: R6 and R8.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: same Y3. Overlapping.\n\n6 &9: R6 and R9.\n\nx: adjacent.\n\ny: same Y3. Overlapping.\n\n7 &8: R7 and R8.\n\nx: X3 vs X3: same.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y2: overlap. Overlapping.\n\n7 &9: R7 and R9.\n\nx: same X3.\n\ny: Y1 vs Y3: share y=1. Overlapping.\n\n8 &9: R8 and R9.\n\nx: same X3.\n\ny: same Y3. Overlapping.\n\nWow, so in this 2x2 grid of squares, every pai